{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a new custom Shopify section inspired by the provided reference image.
    
    Section title:
    “Find Plant Category”
    Use a modern botanical style with a soft pale green/cream background.
    
    LAYOUT:
    - Create a responsive plant-category grid.
    - Desktop: display 6 circular plant category cards across the first row.
    - Second row: display 4 circular plant category cards followed by a large “Buy Now!” CTA card.
    - Tablet and mobile should automatically adjust into 2–3 columns depending on screen width.
    - Keep the section centered with generous spacing and a clean premium nursery-store appearance.
    
    PLANT CATEGORY CARDS:
    Create editable category blocks with:
    1. Circular plant image
    2. Category name below the image
    3. Hover animation
    4. Clickable link
    
    Use these default categories:
    - Flower Creepers
    - Leaf Creepers
    - Succulent Creepers
    - Flower Plant
    - Herbs
    - Leaf Plant
    - Ornamental Flower
    - Ornamental Leaf
    - Ornamental Vegetable Plant
    - Fruit Plant
    
    HOVER EFFECT:
    - On hover, slightly enlarge the circular plant image using a smooth scale animation.
    - Add a subtle shadow/glow around the image.
    - Slightly move the category name upward.
    - Add a smooth transition of approximately 0.3s.
    - Show a subtle visual indication that the category is clickable.
    - Keep the design elegant and not overly animated.
    
    LINKS:
    Every plant category must have its own editable Shopify URL setting.
    Allow the merchant to select/link each category to:
    - Collection
    - Product
    - Page
    - Blog
    - External URL
    
    CTA CARD:
    Create a large rounded rectangular “Buy Now!” card on the second row.
    - Pale yellow background
    - Thick white border
    - Rounded corners
    - Large italic/script-style “Buy Now!” text
    - Add a curved arrow underneath pointing toward the clickable area
    - Make the entire CTA card clickable.
    - Add an editable Shopify link setting.
    - Add hover animation with a slight scale-up and shadow.
    
    SHOPIFY THEME EDITOR SETTINGS:
    Allow the merchant to edit:
    - Section heading
    - Heading font size
    - Heading color
    - Background color
    - Category image size
    - Category name font size
    - Category text color
    - Card spacing
    - Number of columns on desktop/tablet/mobile
    - Hover scale
    - Hover shadow
    - CTA text
    - CTA background color
    - CTA link
    - CTA text size
    - Section top and bottom padding
    
    IMAGE SETTINGS:
    - Each category must have its own image picker.
    - Images should automatically be displayed as perfect circles.
    - Use object-fit: cover.
    - Add a clean white border around each circular image.
    - Do not crop or distort the images unnecessarily.
    
    DESIGN:
    - Match the reference image's clean botanical aesthetic.
    - Use soft cream/pale-green tones.
    - Use a bold modern heading with the word “Category” in italic green.
    - Keep the section lightweight, elegant, and premium.
    - Do not use external libraries or apps.
    - Use only Shopify Liquid, HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.
    - Make it fully responsive.
    - Make sure all links work correctly.
    - Make all text, images, URLs, colors, spacing, and sizing editable from the Shopify Theme Editor.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% liquid
  # On mobile the Buy Now card fills whatever is left of the last category row.
  assign category_count = 0
  for i in (1..10)
    assign name_key = 'category_' | append: i | append: '_name'
    if block.settings[name_key] != blank
      assign category_count = category_count | plus: 1
    endif
  endfor
  assign mobile_cols = block.settings.mobile_columns | plus: 0
  assign mobile_cta_span = category_count | modulo: mobile_cols
  assign mobile_cta_span = mobile_cols | minus: mobile_cta_span
%}

{% style %}
  .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top }}px 24px {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
  }
  .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1440px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading {
    margin: 0 0 42px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.12;
    font-weight: 750;
    text-align: center;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }
  .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading em {
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat({{ block.settings.desktop_columns }}, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: {{ block.settings.card_spacing }}px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card {
    min-width: 0;
    color: {{ block.settings.category_text_color }};
    text-decoration: none;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 13px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image-wrap {
    width: min({{ block.settings.image_size }}px, 100%);
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 4px solid #fff;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #e9eddf;
    box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(20, 35, 26, 0.08);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }
  .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image-wrap img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
  }
  .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    color: #cad3bf;
  }
  .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__name {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.name_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.35;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
  }
  .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:hover .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image-wrap,
  .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:focus-visible .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image-wrap {
    transform: scale({{ block.settings.hover_scale | divided_by: 100.0 }});
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(31, 81, 48, {{ block.settings.hover_shadow | divided_by: 100.0 }});
  }
  .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:hover .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__name,
  .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:focus-visible .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__name {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
  }
  .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:focus-visible,
  .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    outline-offset: 5px;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
  .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta {
    grid-column: span 2;
    min-height: {{ block.settings.image_size }}px;
    align-self: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 20px;
    border: 8px solid #fff;
    border-radius: 28px;
    background: {{ block.settings.cta_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.cta_text_color }};
    text-decoration: none;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 5px 14px rgba(20, 35, 26, 0.08);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }
  .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta:hover {
    transform: scale(1.035);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 26px rgba(20, 35, 26, 0.16);
  }
  .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta-label {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: {{ block.settings.cta_text_size }}px;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow {
    width: 74px;
    height: 35px;
    color: {{ block.settings.cta_text_color }};
  }
  @media (max-width: 990px) {
    .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat({{ block.settings.tablet_columns }}, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-left: 16px;
      padding-right: 16px;
    }
    .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat({{ block.settings.mobile_columns }}, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
    .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading {
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta {
      grid-column: span {{ mobile_cta_span }};
      justify-self: center;
      width: min(100%, 210px);
      min-height: 96px;
      gap: 4px;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border-width: 5px;
      border-radius: 18px;
    }
    .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta-label {
      font-size: min({{ block.settings.cta_text_size }}px, 6vw);
    }
    .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow {
      width: 52px;
      height: 24px;
    }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image-wrap,
    .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__name,
    .ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta { transition: none; }
  }
/* Mobile: tighter section spacing */@media screen and (max-width: 749px){.ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}{padding-top:{{ block.settings.padding_top | at_most: 24 }}px;padding-bottom:{{ block.settings.padding_bottom | at_most: 24 }}px}.ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading{margin-bottom:20px}}{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="width: {{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner">
    {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
      <h2 class="ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }} <em>{{ block.settings.heading_emphasis | escape }}</em></h2>
    {% endif %}
    <div class="ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid">
      {% for i in (1..10) %}
        {% liquid
          assign image_key = 'category_' | append: i | append: '_image'
          assign name_key = 'category_' | append: i | append: '_name'
          assign link_key = 'category_' | append: i | append: '_link'
          assign category_image = block.settings[image_key]
          assign category_name = block.settings[name_key]
          assign category_link = block.settings[link_key]
        %}
        {% if category_name != blank %}
          <a class="ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card" href="{{ category_link | default: routes.all_products_collection_url }}" aria-label="{{ category_name | escape }}">
            <span class="ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image-wrap">
              {% if category_image != blank %}
                <img src="{{ category_image | image_url: width: 600 }}" alt="{{ category_image.alt | default: category_name | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ category_image.width }}" height="{{ category_image.height }}">
              {% else %}
                <span class="ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder">{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</span>
              {% endif %}
            </span>
            <span class="ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__name">{{ category_name | escape }}</span>
          </a>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
      <a class="ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta" href="{{ block.settings.cta_link | default: routes.all_products_collection_url }}" aria-label="{{ block.settings.cta_text | escape }}">
        <span class="ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta-label">{{ block.settings.cta_text | escape }}</span>
        <svg class="ai-plant-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" viewBox="0 0 90 42" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M5 7C25 33 55 39 78 20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <path d="M66 14L79 19L70 30" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

